# ─── Registry root: canonical clones (OMN-19388) ─────────────────────────────
# This clone is the registry root. Every canonical clone the registry holds sits
# directly inside it under the same directory name, exactly as under registry_root,
# and is never tracked here. Work happens in worktrees under worktrees/.
/knowledge_base/
/docs_repo/
# OMN-20839: the old directory name is kept as a symlink to docs_repo until every
# consumer has adopted the rename; a symlink is not a directory to git, so it needs its own line.
/docs-repo
